Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:52.30,0:01:57.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\an1}櫻樹之花 何時綻放
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:58.50,0:02:02.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\an1}山麓莊中 何時綻放
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:03.70,0:02:08.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\an1}櫻樹之花 何時芬芳
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:10.00,0:02:14.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\an1}七子顏笑 玩耍時常
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:15.20,0:02:20.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\an1}櫻樹之花 何時飄蕩
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:21.10,0:02:25.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\an1}七子詠歌 沉入夢鄉
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:26.50,0:02:31.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\an1}櫻樹之花 何時凋亡
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:32.70,0:02:37.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,3500)\an1}七子逝去 魂昇天上
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:52.30,0:01:57.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\an9}さくらの花は　いつ開く
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:58.50,0:02:02.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\an9}山のお里に　いつ開く
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:03.70,0:02:08.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\an9}さくらの花は　いつ匂う
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:10.00,0:02:14.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\an9}笑う七の子　遊ぶ頃
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:15.20,0:02:20.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\an9}さくらの花は　いつ踊る
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:21.10,0:02:25.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\an9}歌う七の子　眠る頃
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:26.50,0:02:31.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\an9}さくらの花は　いつ朽ちる
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:32.70,0:02:37.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,3500)\fn华文细黑\an9}死んだ七の子　昇る頃
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:33.56,0:02:38.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&H0000FF&}黃昏村落
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:44.50,0:02:45.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鶇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:46.30,0:02:47.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看這個啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:48.40,0:02:49.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很過分吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:50.20,0:02:51.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:51.20,0:02:52.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,男生啊 男生
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:52.80,0:02:55.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鈴木那傢伙硬扯來着
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:56.20,0:02:57.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,壞了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:58.00,0:03:02.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 而且鈴木那個傢伙邊笑邊跑掉了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:02.50,0:03:03.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可原諒 對吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:04.40,0:03:06.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抓住他讓他道歉的話…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:06.60,0:03:08.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,道歉也不行
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:08.40,0:03:10.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 已經壞了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:10.90,0:03:13.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對了 讓他下地獄吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:14.00,0:03:16.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這主意好 就這麼辦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:16.60,0:03:19.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,讓地獄少女把鈴木送下地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:19.60,0:03:21.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那個傢伙那麼討厭
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:21.20,0:03:23.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,倒不如消失了好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:57.40,0:03:58.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被你嚇死了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:59.70,0:04:00.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對不起
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:01.00,0:04:04.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,醫院打電話給我的時候 我心跳都停了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:05.30,0:04:05.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對不起
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:13.20,0:04:14.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是個好人吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:15.70,0:04:17.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那個司機
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:17.50,0:04:20.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明明是我不好他還一直道歉
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:28.00,0:04:33.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果 如果我在剛纔的事故里死了的話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:34.90,0:04:38.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿一會恨那個司機嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:39.00,0:04:40.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,傻瓜 說什麼呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:41.70,0:04:42.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是個好人呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:43.70,0:04:47.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是如果我死了你也想會殺死他吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:50.70,0:04:51.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:52.10,0:04:54.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我越來越糊塗了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:59.90,0:05:00.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對不起
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:02.10,0:05:03.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我決定放棄了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:05.50,0:05:06.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地獄少女
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:06.80,0:05:10.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,絕不會再在你面前提了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:10.90,0:05:12.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你就都忘掉吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:13.00,0:05:14.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿一
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:15.00,0:05:16.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,來 把眼淚擦擦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:31.40,0:05:32.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:32.90,0:05:36.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這樣啊 對方的日程安排如何呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:37.20,0:05:39.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 好好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:37.80,0:05:38.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\pos(300,469)}媽媽
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:40.40,0:05:41.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那麼拜託了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:42.10,0:05:42.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這樣好嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:44.20,0:05:46.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就這樣結束真的好嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:50.30,0:05:51.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:53.00,0:05:54.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 好消息
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:55.80,0:05:57.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要去夏威夷採訪
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:58.50,0:05:59.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,夏威夷
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:00.20,0:06:02.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以混在採訪費用裏 一起去吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:03.10,0:06:06.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很簡單的採訪 就當去玩吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:07.00,0:06:08.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,享受大海吧 鶇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:09.50,0:06:10.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿一
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:12.60,0:06:14.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼了 不喜歡嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:14.80,0:06:15.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那可是夏威夷
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:17.70,0:06:19.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,當然要去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:19.60,0:06:23.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 這下就決定了 馬上就訂票
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:26.10,0:06:26.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去倒茶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:28.50,0:06:29.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好奇怪啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:30.50,0:06:34.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明明把那個騙人的旅行社的電話記下了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:34.70,0:06:36.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,騙人的可不行
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:38.50,0:06:38.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鶇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:39.80,0:06:42.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你認識仙太郎嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:43.70,0:06:44.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你認識嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:45.80,0:06:46.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地獄少女
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:49.80,0:06:50.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鶇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:56.40,0:06:59.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住手吧 請你住手吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:00.20,0:07:01.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不會再妨礙你了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:01.20,0:07:02.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不會再追着你了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:03.10,0:07:05.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以快離開我的女兒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:05.90,0:07:08.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你了 不要接近她
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:15.80,0:07:16.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿一
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:17.50,0:07:19.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鶇 你意識恢復了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:21.20,0:07:22.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這樣下去不行
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:23.20,0:07:24.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這樣下去就沒有終結
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:25.50,0:07:28.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爲什麼呢 她想告訴我什麼呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:29.80,0:07:31.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我必須去見地獄少女
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:32.20,0:07:32.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鶇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:34.00,0:07:34.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是你…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:36.50,0:07:39.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也想知道答案
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:47.60,0:07:50.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,愛 怎麼了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:51.40,0:07:54.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒什麼 婆婆
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:54.90,0:07:56.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有什麼煩惱嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:58.20,0:08:00.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒有 沒事的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:02.20,0:08:03.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,難道你…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:06.40,0:08:07.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒事的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:16.00,0:08:17.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,六道鄉嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:18.20,0:08:21.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地獄少女和那個男孩曾在那裏
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:22.80,0:08:23.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,仙太郎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:24.90,0:08:26.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是誰呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:26.40,0:08:28.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和地獄少女又是什麼關係呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:29.60,0:08:32.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爲什麼要讓你知道
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:46.80,0:08:47.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:55.90,0:08:56.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不在嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:03.20,0:09:04.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要嚇我啊 混蛋
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:09.00,0:09:13.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這個季節 幾乎就沒有客人來了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:14.30,0:09:19.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本來就冷 下雪的話又看不到難得的風景
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:20.20,0:09:21.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原來如此
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:21.50,0:09:23.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每年這個時候都是下雪天
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:24.00,0:09:26.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,客人您運氣真好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:28.10,0:09:28.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:30.20,0:09:30.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下雪了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:31.00,0:09:34.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的呢 真討厭 纔剛說就…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:36.30,0:09:37.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已經可以洗澡了嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:38.80,0:09:40.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,請
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:41.30,0:09:43.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鶇 去洗個澡吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:44.00,0:09:44.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一個人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:48.50,0:09:50.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對不起 說了奇怪的話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:56.40,0:09:58.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我來帶路
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:59.30,0:10:00.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:06.60,0:10:09.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這種時候怎麼辦好啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:24.10,0:10:24.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感覺到了嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:30.10,0:10:32.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在這風景中你感覺到什麼了嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:55.00,0:10:58.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我來了 鶇 爸爸來了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:03.00,0:11:03.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿一
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:12.00,0:11:13.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,問你對風景感覺到什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:14.50,0:11:15.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這麼說的麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:17.00,0:11:18.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼意思呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:19.50,0:11:22.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這麼偏僻的地方可是頭一次來
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:41.90,0:11:43.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,謝謝你 真是個好孩子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:44.40,0:11:44.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用謝
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:45.60,0:11:50.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天晴了真好 雪也沒有積得恨深
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:51.20,0:11:53.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你們想去什麼地方呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:53.90,0:11:58.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,話說這個村子裏有個地方適合遠眺風景
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:59.00,0:12:02.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老闆娘 這個地方遠嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:06.90,0:12:10.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這裏過去大概二十分鐘
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:11.20,0:12:14.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是嘛 請告訴我們怎麼去吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:14.40,0:12:17.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那個 現在可是冬天啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:30.80,0:12:32.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這附近的事情嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:33.20,0:12:35.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過我不是這裏出生的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:37.30,0:12:39.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去寺院問問怎麼樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:39.60,0:12:40.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,寺院
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:40.70,0:12:43.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正好在去瀑布的途中有一座
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:43.30,0:12:47.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那裏的住持可能會知道些吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:17.50,0:13:18.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,請用
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:18.90,0:13:21.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,雖是粗茶 但亦能暖身
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:22.20,0:13:23.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我喝了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:25.80,0:13:27.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,從東京來還真是遠啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:28.60,0:13:30.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且還是這種季節
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:31.10,0:13:34.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,雜誌的採訪也真是很辛苦啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:35.70,0:13:36.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪裏
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:37.60,0:13:38.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,柴田先生
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:39.70,0:13:41.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這又是巧合
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:42.20,0:13:42.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:56.90,0:13:58.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,關於從前的事情嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:59.70,0:14:04.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其實我也不是這裏出身的人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:05.70,0:14:07.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是被請到這裏來的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:08.10,0:14:09.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這樣啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:09.90,0:14:12.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對不起 我幫不上你的忙
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:13.00,0:14:14.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 沒關係
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:17.00,0:14:19.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是黑糖 很好喫的哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:20.40,0:14:21.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,黑糖
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:28.60,0:14:30.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,保持了以前的風味
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:31.40,0:14:33.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的 很好喫
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:34.00,0:14:35.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:35.90,0:14:39.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對了 我想起了一件事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:40.80,0:14:43.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,“送七”的風俗不知你們可曾知道
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:48.50,0:14:49.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,送七
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:50.40,0:14:53.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,似乎是以前這附近的風俗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:54.00,0:14:59.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爲了向山神祈禱無病消災五穀豐登
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:59.90,0:15:06.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每七年向山奉上剛滿七歲的女孩
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:07.60,0:15:10.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把七歲的孩子獻給山神
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:12.50,0:15:13.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和我一樣年紀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:15.20,0:15:18.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七是代表陰陽中陽的數字
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:18.50,0:15:19.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很吉祥的數字
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:20.50,0:15:22.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被認爲能象徵喜事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:23.20,0:15:28.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,並能帶來喜事的數字
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:29.30,0:15:35.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爲了給村子代來喜事就將七歲的孩子獻給神
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:10.00,0:16:17.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這個寺就是爲鎮慰那些在山裏徘徊的幼小的靈魂而建造的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:18.20,0:16:20.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以名字就叫…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:20.60,0:16:23.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 而且建這所寺廟的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:23.80,0:16:27.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其實就是做這黑糖的第一代當家的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:32.40,0:16:37.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,興建於四百年前安土桃山時代
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:38.00,0:16:40.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,當家的本就是這裏出身的人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:40.90,0:16:43.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出於一些原因離開了這裏
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:43.40,0:16:46.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,後來經營黑糖的店鋪而成功了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:58.80,0:17:05.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,現在呢 似乎和第一代當家有血緣的人已經不在店裏了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:06.30,0:17:12.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過還是每年幾次把糖當作供品送來
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:13.00,0:17:15.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是叫什麼的店呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:16.40,0:17:20.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對 那就是我剛纔說的巧合
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:21.70,0:17:23.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,叫柴田屋
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:25.20,0:17:26.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,柴田
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:28.60,0:17:29.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是這樣啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:36.20,0:17:37.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是這樣的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:39.50,0:17:44.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住持 柴田家第一代的名字叫
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:50.50,0:17:53.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,據說叫仙太郎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:04.90,0:18:08.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看樣子你那邊似乎也沒找到呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:11.20,0:18:13.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也不行啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:13.20,0:18:16.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我們真是沒用透了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:16.50,0:18:17.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要這麼說
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:17.80,0:18:21.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 小姐到哪兒去了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:23.20,0:18:27.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不是去做事最近一不留神就不見了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:28.70,0:18:31.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看 小姐也差不多到這年紀了 好疼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:32.00,0:18:33.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是開玩笑的時候嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:34.00,0:18:36.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那也不用丟我吧 好痛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:38.10,0:18:38.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回來了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:45.00,0:18:45.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:46.10,0:18:47.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是那個啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:48.00,0:18:50.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等 難不成…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:01.80,0:19:04.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看到的風景是這裏嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:10.70,0:19:12.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是誰堆的呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:33.10,0:19:33.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這是…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:41.10,0:19:41.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,閻魔愛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:45.20,0:19:46.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抓到了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:46.70,0:19:49.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,討厭 放開我仙太郎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:50.50,0:19:51.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,仙太郎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:52.10,0:19:52.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,討厭
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:52.80,0:19:57.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地獄少女和仙太郎兩個人是青梅竹馬
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:02.30,0:20:03.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你們來了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:07.10,0:20:07.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地獄少女
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:10.50,0:20:11.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,還留着啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:16.30,0:20:18.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如今不祥之血還沒有斷絕
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:19.70,0:20:21.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那血使我迷亂
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:22.60,0:20:25.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不祥 你到底在說什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:36.00,0:20:38.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住手吧 住手吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:38.80,0:20:40.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求求你 住手吧…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:41.60,0:20:42.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求求你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:43.60,0:20:46.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住手吧 仙太郎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:49.80,0:20:51.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鶇 沒事吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:53.20,0:20:54.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被活埋了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:58.20,0:20:59.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你被活埋了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:01.80,0:21:03.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你被仙太郎…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:05.50,0:21:07.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,還想殺我一次嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:08.10,0:21:10.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跨越了時間的你又想像那時一樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:11.90,0:21:14.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已經承擔了一切
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:15.60,0:21:17.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不會再被殺死了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:20.90,0:21:22.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,消失吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:33.90,0:21:35.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然是這裏
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:35.40,0:21:36.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可以 小姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:37.10,0:21:40.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住手 不能憑感情殺人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:41.00,0:21:43.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小姐會被送下地獄的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:44.20,0:21:46.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我那樣也無所謂
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:47.20,0:21:50.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟了 心靈被憎恨支配了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:01.70,0:22:02.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快逃
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:03.50,0:22:05.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你們在做什麼 快點
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:12.90,0:22:14.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小姐 住手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:14.50,0:22:15.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,消失吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:29.80,0:22:33.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:39.40,0:22:40.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:48.90,0:22:50.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我無所謂
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:55.70,0:22:58.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,此怨此恨 流向地獄就好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:15.20,0:23:20.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}い{\K30}つ{\K30}だっ{\K200}て {\K30}行{\K30}き{\K30}止{\K30}まり{\K200}で
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:21.70,0:23:28.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K60}決{\K20}し{\K100}て {\K40}逃{\K45}げ{\K40}ら{\K40}れ{\K70}な{\K200}い
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:28.60,0:23:41.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K40}空{\K140}の{\K40}鳥{\K120}へ {\K40}哀{\K40}し{\K80}み{\K80}の{\K200}せ {\K100}飛{\K40}ば{\K80}す{\K200}の
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:45.70,0:23:49.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K50}ここ{\K140}は{\K20}仮{\K70}縫{\K70}い
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:49.50,0:23:59.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K210}私{\K180}を{\K60\K100}縛{\K60}る{\K30\K140}永{\K200}遠
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:00.50,0:24:06.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K80}行{\K20}き{\K100}も{\K30\K100}帰{\K80}り{\K200}も
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:07.50,0:24:19.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K40}過{\K30}ぎ{\K40}て{\K40\K240}ゆ{\K220}く{\K220}は{\K100}夢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:30.00,0:24:32.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本故事純屬虛構\N登場人物名 團體名等全部與現實無關
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:32.80,0:24:36.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小姐 你什麼壞事都沒有做
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:37.80,0:24:39.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不論什麼時代也是如此
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:40.00,0:24:45.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人這東西就是爲了自己的幸福而去傷害他人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:46.50,0:24:48.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用罪孽來掩蓋罪孽
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:49.70,0:24:53.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到了那時 怨念油然而生
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:53.80,0:24:56.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對 就和小姐一樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:57.02,0:25:01.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an7\c&H0000FF&}下集
